# Post sources. GitHub Pages serves every file on the branch, so while these
# were tracked they were live and crawlable at frameshift.dk (confirmed HTTP
# 200), publishing stale prose the rendered pages had already corrected. Kept
# locally as the source of truth for the articles.
posts/*/post.md
posts/*/linkedin_post.md
posts/*/post.txt

